schemaVersion: 1
id: deal-watch-root
name: Deal Watch
kind: root
version: 0.1.0
description: Every morning, the deals and leads that need a person today, ranked, each with the facts and one next step.
entry: index.md
domain: Sales
app: board
connectors:
  - id: salesforce
    need: needs
    access: [read, create, change]
    why: Reads deals, tasks and leads to spot risk. In a chat, changes one thing after your yes.
prompts:
  - text: Which deals need me today?
    connector: salesforce
  - text: Which deals slipped this week?
    connector: salesforce
  - text: What is closing this month, and how much?
    connector: salesforce
  - text: Which big deals have gone quiet?
    connector: salesforce
  - text: Which new leads has nobody called yet?
    connector: salesforce
  - text: Draft a nudge for my most urgent deal
    connector: salesforce
  - text: What did we win and lose this week?
    connector: salesforce
